{
  "说明": [
    "双端共享夹具：Dart 侧 app/test/domain/slots_fixture_test.dart 与 JS 侧 web/test/rules.test.mjs 各跑一遍。",
    "期望值是**手算**的，不是从任何一侧的实现跑出来的 —— 用代码生成期望值等于让同一段逻辑给自己判卷。",
    "手算用的参照：Python datetime 独立算出的 epochDay 与 weekday（见各 case 的 备注）。",
    "格式约定：",
    "  task.repeat  = App 的 repeat_json 解析后的对象（已展开成对象，不是字符串）",
    "  task.time    = App 的 time_json 解析后的对象",
    "  task.courseStart/courseEnd/courseTotalDays = tasks 表的三列；全 null 表示长期",
    "  expected     = [[slotIndex, dueDate, dueTime], ...]，按 (dueDate+dueTime, taskId, index) 升序",
    "  dueDate/dueTime 是**真实触发日期/时刻**（已跨天折算），不是疗程日"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "每天 20:00，三天窗口",
      "备注": "最简基线：index 每天从 0 重来",
      "date": "2026-10-24",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "repeat": {},
          "time": {
            "type": "fixed",
            "times": [
              "20:00"
            ]
          },
          "courseStart": null,
          "courseEnd": null,
          "courseTotalDays": null
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        [
          "a1",
          0,
          "2026-10-24",
          "20:00"
        ]
      ],
      "spanDays": 1
    },
